{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><div class=\"page\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">由無綫集團有限公司主辦，全城矚目的選美盛事《</span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">2026 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">香港小 姐競選決賽》將於今</span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">(30 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">日</span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">晚 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">8 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">時假 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">TVB </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">隆重舉行，翡翠台將現場直播整晚盛況， </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">12 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">位候選佳麗將競逐本年度香港小姐冠、亞、季軍、最上鏡小姐、友誼小姐榮銜及總值超逾港幣 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">651 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">萬元獎金及獎品，當中包括由六福珠寶送出金鑽后 冠及名貴珠寶首飾總值港幣 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">532 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">萬元。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">節目亦將會直播及轉播至新加坡、馬來西 亞、澳洲、新西蘭、歐洲、英國、美國及加拿大;海外觀眾亦可透過 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">TVB Anywhere </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">、</span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">TVBAnywhere+</span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">流動應用程式、</span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">TVB Anywhere North America </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">流動應用程式，一同見證新一屆香港小姐誕生。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">一眾嘉賓將會盛裝亮相由紅地氈隆重登場， </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">TVB YouTube </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">官方頻道、娛樂新聞台 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">YouTube </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">頻道、</span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">Facebook </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">專頁及香港小姐 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">Facebook </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">專頁「</span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">Miss Hong Kong Pageant</span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">」等平台將於晚上 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">6 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">時 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">30 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">分開始全程直擊 紅地氈。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026fqeoitBdeJ1788080074.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1.JPG\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"page\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">大會日前安排 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">12 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">位候選佳麗互選「友誼小姐」，並進行泳裝綵排及試戴后冠。一眾佳麗以泳裝亮相，展示連月來努力訓練成果，盡顯自信魅力一面。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\"> 大會即場公布由佳麗互選的「友誼小姐」結果，並由 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">2025 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">友誼小姐李尹嫣公布結果，最終由</span>李澄晴奪得。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">此外，大會並邀得第 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">25 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">年贊助香港小姐競選大會指定專用金鑽后冠及名貴珠寶首飾六福集團執行董事兼副行政總裁黃蘭詩女士，聯同 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">2025 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">香港小姐冠軍陳詠詩為被抽中的幸運佳麗</span>盧蔚晴<span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">試戴后冠，金鑽后冠由六福珠寶送出， 總值港幣</span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">500 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">萬元。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20264VfdCzgwMf1788080073.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6.JPG\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"page\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">今年大會評判由著名時裝設計師馬偉明先生</span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">主席評判</span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">、香港 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">QMark </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">優質 誌局主席陳嘉賢教授太平紳士、仁濟醫院董事局主席羅穎怡女士、香港工業 總會主席林世豪先生、世界著名香港男高音莫華倫博士擔任。「最上鏡小姐」 評判包括:著名歌手及教育家陳美齡博士、著名影星及國際中華小姐冠軍苟芸慧小姐、著名演員伍允龍先生、著名演員謝天華先生。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">《</span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">2026 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">香港小姐競選決賽》大會司儀由馬國明、蕭正楠、曹永廉、陸浩明及鄭 衍峰擔任，演出嘉賓陣容鼎盛，有梁漢文、</span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">Gin Lee </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">李幸倪、曾比特、張與辰、 </span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">MYNT </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">傾力演出，而梁漢文將率領郭柏妍、陳楨怡、謝淑怡同台表演。</span><span style=\"font-family: TimesNewRomanPSMT;\">12 </span><span style=\"font-family: PMingLiU;\">位候 選佳麗將會在不同主題的環節中，分別穿著泳裝、晚裝、旗袍等各具風格的服 飾亮相，穿梭在各演出嘉賓的舞台上，亦會呈獻精心準備的才藝表演，展現各方面美態及才華，角逐新一屆的香港小姐冠軍寶座。另特備節目《一周星星》 將緊接決賽後直播，得獎佳麗即時分享得獎感受。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026IxWC7SR6ru1788080072.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2.JPG\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3.JPG\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026THSgMf0mNN1788080072.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3.JPG\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"M.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026eNe19K4czi1788080072.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"M.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T09:18:27.421694+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1103,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}